                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I've been playing Paladins since back when it had its own launcher, long before I ever added it to Steam, and this game has a special place in my heart.\n\nDespite all the ups and downs over the years, I still love this game. The champion variety, unique abilities, team compositions, and the amount of ways you can approach a match are what kept me coming back. There's something special about Paladins that makes it stand out from other hero shooters, and no other game has quite managed to replace that feeling for me.\n\nOf course, the game isn't perfect, and it has had its fair share of issues, but I still appreciate the fun, memories, and countless hours I've spent playing it.\n\nI'm not here to say it's flawless. I'm here because, after all these years, I still care about this game and want to see it do well.\n\nIf you've never tried Paladins, give it a shot. And if you've been here since the old launcher days, you know exactly what I mean.\n\n[b]Recommended. Always will be.[/b]",
